{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34170","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 销夏湾 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 销夏湾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霞岛焰难泊，云峰奇未收。\n萧条千里湾，独自清如秋。\n古岸过新雨，高萝荫横流。\n遥风吹蒹葭，折处鸣飕飕。\n昔予守圭窦，过於回禄囚。\n日爲蘧筁徒，分作祗裯雠。\n愿狎寒水怪，不封朱毂侯。\n岂知烟浪涯，坐可思重裘。\n健若数尺鲤，泛然双白鸥。\n不识号火井，孰问名焦丘。\n我真鱼鸟家，尽室营扁舟。\n遗名复避世，消夏还消忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}